[{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0300","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-3351","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 和 Edge 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 9至11及Microsoft Edge浏览器存在信息泄漏漏洞。当用户访问攻击者精心构造的恶意网站时，浏览器可能错误地泄露内存中的敏感信息，导致攻击者能够获取本应受到保护的数据。该漏洞无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（点击链接或浏览恶意页面），CVSS评分6.5，危害等级中危。Microsoft已在2016年9月安全更新（MS16-096）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2016-3351"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-09-14T10:59:24Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:45:32Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2016 年 9 月安全更新 MS16-104（KB3185319），该更新通过 Windows Update 自动获取，或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。Windows 10 用户需安装对应的累积更新 KB3185611/KB3185614/KB3189866。对于无法立即打补丁的系统，可启用 Internet Explorer 增强安全配置（ESC）并部署 EMET 工具作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/92788","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1036788","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1036789","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2016/ms16-104","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2016/ms16-105","https://www.brokenbrowser.com/detecting-apps-mimetype-malware/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-3351","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-3351.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2016/3xxx/CVE-2016-3351.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-3351","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2016/CVE-2016-3351.rules","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-3351.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/SSVC/data/2016/CVE-2016-3351.json","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2016/CVE-2016-3351.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-p53p-2wmf-238v/GHSA-p53p-2wmf-238v.json","https://github.com/trietptm/Security-News/blob/e46fe769bfa56f60b70561bb4b637851150da4d0/Twitter/Zube/2016/2016_09_14.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2016/POC-AVE-2016-0300.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0300.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0067","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0067.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-5674","title":"NUUO NVRmini2/NVRsolo 及 NETGEAR ReadyNAS Surveillance 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"NUUO NVRmini 2、NUUO NVRsolo 及 NETGEAR ReadyNAS Surveillance 等网络视频录像机（NVR）产品的 __debugging_center_utils___.php 文件中存在输入验证不当漏洞（CWE-20）。远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过向该脚本的 log 参数传递特制的 PHP 代码，利用该漏洞实现任意 PHP 代码执行，进而完全控制目标设备。攻击无需任何权限或用户交互，仅需网络可达即可触发，危害严重。该漏洞影响 NUUO NVRmini 2 1.7.5 至 3.0.0、NUUO NVRsolo 1.7.5 至 3.0.0 及 NETGEAR ReadyNAS Surveillance 1.1.1 至 1.4.1 版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-5674"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-08-31T15:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:49:51Z","remediation":"厂商 NUUO 和 NETGEAR 未发布任何安全补丁，建议立即将受影响的 NUUO NVRmini 2（固件 1.7.5~3.0.0）、NUUO NVRsolo（固件 1.0.0~3.0.0）及 NETGEAR ReadyNAS Surveillance（1.1.1~1.4.1）设备从公网隔离，禁止暴露在不可信网络中；在防火墙层面限制对设备 80/443 端口的访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 连接；如业务允许，建议更换为已维护的替代产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/856152","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/92318","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40200/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-5674.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2016/CVE-2016-5674.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-5674.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2016/5xxx/CVE-2016-5674.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-5674","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/9f33e551f5d4c0bb4df8de596869fddfb4c874cc/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-5674.yaml","https://github.com/gottburgm/Exploits/blob/fd340a05cbec416e89bfae898e27bf5fcb429101/MSFExploits/NUUO/MSF/NuuoNvrminiUnauthRce.pm","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-5674_2.yaml","https://github.com/1979139113/0day-today-exploits/blob/8b2194688e3c722fe9369b045e37382e7f45e12b/25455.txt","https://github.com/UMBC-Onramp/CyEnts-Cyber-Blog-Dataset/blob/d8b7716ce5f02208e93484a41a6d0f0da4a811e0/Sentences/totolink-vulnerabilities-beastmode-mirai-campaign.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2016/POC-AVE-2016-0067.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2016/EXP-AVE-2016-0067.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0067.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0068","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0068.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-6195","title":"vBulletin ForumRunner SQL注入漏洞","description":"vBulletin 论坛系统 forumrunner/includes/moderation.php 文件中存在 SQL 注入漏洞，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 forumrunner/request.php 发送特制的 postids 参数，在数据库查询中注入恶意 SQL 语句，导致任意 SQL 命令执行。攻击者可利用该漏洞窃取数据库中的用户凭证、论坛配置等敏感信息，甚至进一步获取服务器控制权。该漏洞影响 vBulletin 4.2.2 Patch Level 5 之前版本及 4.2.3 Patch Level 1 之前版本，已在 2016 年 7 月被野外利用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-6195"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-08-30T19:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:50:37Z","remediation":"立即升级 vBulletin 至 4.2.2 Patch Level 5 或 4.2.3 Patch Level 1 及以上版本，该漏洞已在上述版本中修复。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器层面（如 Nginx/Apache）添加规则拦截对 /forumrunner/request.php 的 POST 请求，并过滤 postids 参数中的恶意 SQL 语句作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/92687","http://www.vbulletin.org/forum/showthread.php?t=322848","https://enumerated.wordpress.com/2016/07/11/1/","https://github.com/drewlong/vbully","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40751","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-6195.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2016/CVE-2016-6195.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-6195.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2016/6xxx/CVE-2016-6195.json","https://github.com/gottburgm/Exploits/blob/fd340a05cbec416e89bfae898e27bf5fcb429101/CVE-2016-6195/README.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2016/CVE-2016-6195.rules","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-6195_1.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2016/CVE-2016-6195.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/a9331e178e67e816fb1e4205a54da7a62362cd2e/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-61xx/CVE-2016-6195.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-6195_3.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0068.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0520","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0520.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-4657","title":"Apple iOS WebKit 内存破坏漏洞","description":"Apple iOS 系统内置的 WebKit 浏览器引擎在处理 JavaScript 的 `defineProperties` 方法时，对 `not_number` 属性的处理存在 use-after-free（释放后使用）漏洞，导致内存破坏。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页，诱导用户访问后触发该漏洞，实现任意代码执行或拒绝服务攻击，无需用户交互或认证。该漏洞影响 iOS 9.3.5 之前的所有版本，曾被 NSO Group 的 Pegasus 间谍软件利用（Trident 攻击链之一），用于在目标设备上实现越狱并植入监控软件，同时该漏洞也影响 Nintendo Switch 浏览器。Apple 已在 iOS 9.3.5 安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-4657"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-08-25T21:59:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:47:58Z","remediation":"立即将 iOS 升级至 9.3.5 或更高版本（设置 → 通用 → 软件更新），该版本修复了 WebKit 内存破坏漏洞。如无法立即升级，可暂时禁用 Safari 的 JavaScript 执行（设置 → Safari → 高级 → JavaScript 关闭），或使用第三方浏览器并启用内容拦截功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2016/Aug/msg00000.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/92653","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1036694","https://blog.lookout.com/blog/2016/08/25/trident-pegasus/","https://support.apple.com/HT207107","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44836/","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xkdPjbaLngE","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-4657","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44836","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-4657.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/6695f20ae08803f774b618dbe76c2549e17160e7/2016/CVE-2016-4657.json","https://github.com/Hacker0x01/hacker101/blob/df1c09d60511d5a690b948217effef52541bcd38/sessions/native_code_crash_course.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-4657","ht