6-0508","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0508.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-4655","title":"Apple iOS 内核信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apple iOS 内核存在信息泄露漏洞（CVE-2016-4655），该漏洞是 Trident 攻击链（Pegasus 间谍软件使用的零日漏洞链）的组成部分之一。攻击者可通过诱导用户安装特制恶意应用程序，利用内核内存处理缺陷读取未授权的内核内存数据，从而泄露敏感信息（如凭据、加密密钥等）。该漏洞影响 iOS 9.3.5 之前的所有版本，攻击需本地访问且依赖用户交互（如点击恶意链接或安装恶意应用），CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。Apple 已在 iOS 9.3.5 安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2016-4655"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-08-25T21:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:47:58Z","remediation":"立即将 iOS 设备升级至 9.3.5 或更高版本（设置 > 通用 > 软件更新）。该漏洞已被 Pegasus 间谍软件在野利用（Trident 漏洞链之一），攻击者可通过恶意 App 读取内核内存。无法升级的旧设备（如 iPhone 4s 以下）建议停止使用或限制安装不可信应用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2016/Aug/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2016/Sep/msg00005.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/92651","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/92965","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1036694","https://blog.lookout.com/blog/2016/08/25/trident-pegasus/","https://support.apple.com/HT207107","https://support.apple.com/HT207145","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44836/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-4655","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-4655.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/6695f20ae08803f774b618dbe76c2549e17160e7/2016/CVE-2016-4655.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-4655","https://github.com/zhengmin1989/iOS_ICE_AND_FIRE/blob/a3949bd0b77daf8cc19dcce4f7fb8ec54a231ab3/PEGASUS/README.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2016/4xxx/CVE-2016-4655.json","https://github.com/killvxk/thg-framework/blob/fab929cd77c91373ebc4212bd4e5891b54f0fb1b/data/source/exploits/CVE-2016-4655/Makefile","https://github.com/Lifka/hacking-resources/blob/7885f95676c3ba4b2ee79fbaf0f6797add892322/tools.md","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/8c2bf6d873542e1e7886b8a7c47221d6e0984e70/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/iPhoneOS/Exploit/Trident.yara","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-4655.txt","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/30530.txt","https://github.com/jndok/PegasusX","https://github.com/tomitokics/br0ke","https://github.com/Cryptiiiic/skybreak","https://github.com/liangle1986126z/jndok"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2016/POC-AVE-2016-0508.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2016/EXP-AVE-2016-0508.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0508.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0609","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0609.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-6367","title":"Cisco ASA/PIX 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Cisco ASA（Adaptive Security Appliance）及 PIX 防火墙设备在处理无效 CLI 命令时存在本地权限提升漏洞（EPICBANANA）。具有低权限的本地攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送特制的无效 CLI 命令，利用命令注入漏洞以更高权限执行任意代码，从而完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 ASA 5500/5500-X、PIX 及 FWSM 系列设备上 8.4(1) 之前版本的软件，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Cisco 已发布安全公告（Bug ID CSCtu74257）建议用户升级至 8.4(1) 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-6367"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-08-18T18:59:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:50:54Z","remediation":"建议升级 Cisco ASA 软件至 8.4(1) 及以上版本，或安装 Cisco 针对 CSCtu74257 发布的安全补丁。同时限制 CLI 管理访问权限，仅允许受信管理员登录，并启用 AAA 认证与命令授权审计。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.cisco.com/security/shadow-brokers","http://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20160817-asa-cli","http://tools.cisco.com/security/center/viewErp.x?alertId=ERP-56516","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/92520","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1036636","https://github.com/offensive-security/exploit-database-bin-sploits/raw/master/sploits/40271.zip","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40271/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-6367","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40271","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-6367.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2016/6xxx/CVE-2016-6367.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-6367","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/local-exploits/25633.txt","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-6367.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/SSVC/data/2016/CVE-2016-6367.json","https://github.com/lanjelot/kb/blob/95e6d3e59746dff428b02e9d21cc91ffc62ee0ac/cisco","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2016/CVE-2016-6367.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2016/CVE-2016-6367.csv","https://github.com/gadievron/raptor/blob/fefd7c05681249b9e0ff7230418083558bda37bb/packages/sca/data/calibration/kev_signals.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0609.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0608","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0608.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-6366","title":"Cisco ASA 软件缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cisco Adaptive Security Appliance (ASA) 软件中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程认证用户可通过向目标设备发送特制的 IPv4 SNMP 数据包触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 ASA 5500、ASA 5500-X、ASA Services Module、ASA 1000V、ASAv、Firepower 9300 ASA Security Module、PIX 及 FWSM 等多款设备，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。攻击者需具备有效认证凭据，利用难度较低。该漏洞又名 EXTRABACON，Cisco 已发布安全更新修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-6366"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-08-18T18:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:50:54Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco ASA 至 9.1(7)+、9.2(4)+、9.3(3.8)+ 或 9.4(2)+ 版本，通过 Cisco.com 下载对应镜像后使用 `copy tftp flash` 上传并 `boot system` 指定新版本重启。临时缓解措施：在受影响设备上限制 SNMP 访问，使用 `access-list` 仅允许受信管理 IP 访问 UDP 161 端口，并禁用 SNMPv1/v2c 只读社区字符串。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.cisco.com/security/shadow-brokers","http://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20160817-asa-snmp","http://tools.cisco.com/security/center/viewErp.x?alertId=ERP-56516","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/92521","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1036637","https://github.com/offensive-security/exploit-database-bin-sploits/raw/master/sploits/40258.zip","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40258/","https://zerosum0x0.blogspot.com/2016/09/reverse-engineering-cisco-asa-for.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-6366","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40258","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-6366.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/6695f20ae08803f774b618dbe76c2549e17160e7/2016/CVE-2016-6366.json","https://github.com/nixawk/pentest-wiki/blob/90d8ad7626f1804d5fe2c1a62c21c6463f8d9bdc/4.Post-Exploitation/How-to-hack-Cisco-ASA-with-CVE-2016-6366.md","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/blob/472bd8320e2c6801740215e4aff621ae2ae69c83/modules/auxiliary/admin/networking/cisco_asa_extrabacon.rb","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-6366","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2016/6xxx/CVE-2016-6366.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2016/CVE-2016-6366/README.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/icopy-site/awesome-cn/blob/6312405a4bb0a38db0e02938ea679c554d894ea7/docs/awesome/awesome-scapy.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-6366.txt","https://github.com/RiskSense-Ops/CVE-2016-6366"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0608.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0222","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0222.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-3309","title":"Microsoft Windows Win32k 权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows 内核模式驱动 win32kfull.sys 中的 bFill 函数存在池溢出漏洞，由于对用户态传入的对象大小验证不充分，导致内核池内存越界写入。本地低权限攻击者可通过构造特制应用程序触发该漏洞，在内核上下文中执行任意代码，从而获取系统最高权限。该漏洞影响 Windows Vista SP2 至 Windows 10 1607 等多个版本，已有公开利用代码，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2016 年 8 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-3309"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-08-09T21:59:16Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:45:28Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2016 年 8 月安全更新 MS16-098 (KB3178539)，该更新修复了 win32k.sys 内核驱动中的池溢出漏洞。通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载安装。临时缓解措施：限制非授权用户本地登录权限，并启用 Windows Defender 应用程序控制策略阻止已知利用载荷运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/92297","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1036572","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2016/ms16-098","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42960/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-3309","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42960","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-3309.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/6695f20ae08803f774b618dbe76c2549e17160e7/2016/CVE-2016-3309.json","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2016-3309/README.md","https://github.com/WindowsExploits/Exploits/blob/ccaaf21ef8fc92941ea285e0160071148631637c/CVE-2016-3309/Readme.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-3309","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2016/3xxx/CVE-2016-3309.json","https://github.com/siberas/CVE-2016-3309_Reloaded/blob/ccd13d2885bf7c0cbf6181897faadc8a4db32720/CVE-2016-3309_Reloaded.sln","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2016/database/CVE-2016-3309/CVE-2016-3309_Reloaded-siberas.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/skill/%E7%BA%A2%E9%98%9F%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E9%9B%86%E9%94%A6.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2016-3309/README_EN.md","https://github.com/siberas/CVE-2016-3309_Reloaded"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0222.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0061","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0061.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-3510","title":"Oracle WebLogic Server T3协议反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle WebLogic Server 的 T3 协议存在反序列化安全漏洞。T3 协议是 WebLogic 用于 Java RMI 通信的专有协议，默认监听 7001 端口。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标 WebLogic 服务器发送精心构造的恶意序列化数据包，触发 T3 协议在处理反序列化操作时的安全缺陷，从而在目标服务器上执行任意代码，完全控制服务器。该漏洞影响 Oracle Fusion Middleware 10.3.6.0、12.1.3.0 及 12.2.1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击无需任何认证或用户交互，仅需目标开放 T3 端口即可远程利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-3510"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-07-21T10:13:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:45:51Z","remediation":"立即安装 Oracle 2016 年 7 月关键补丁更新 (CPU July 2016)，通过 My Oracle Support 获取对应 WebLogic 版本的补丁包并部署。受影响版本包括 10.3.6.0、12.1.3.0 和 12.2.1.0。如无法立即打补丁，可在 WebLogic 控制台禁用 T3 协议（将 `weblogic.security.SSL.enableT3` 设为 false），或在网络防火墙层面封禁 T3 默认端口 7001 的入站连接作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152324/Oracle-Weblogic-Server-Deserialization-MarshalledObject-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpujul2016-2881720.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/91787","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1036373","https://www.tenable.com/security/research/tra-2016-21","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/network/cves/2016/CVE-2016-3510.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-3510.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f015220eb1b2405b0fcce99fab82aef08d37a0ce/2016/CVE-2016-3510.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2016-3510.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/%E4%B8%AD%E9%97%B4%E4%BB%B6%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E/WebLogic%20T3%20%E5%8F%8D%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%E5%8C%96%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2016-3510.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/CVE-2016-3510%E2%80%94%E2%80%94WebLogic_%E5%8F%8D%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%E5%8C%96%E5%88%9D%E6%8E%A2.md","https://github.com/SexyBeast233/SecBooks/blob/eca538546bd6b8eaade595fc9d79ffbecc4d842a/%E3%80%90%E5%85%AC%E4%BC%97%E5%8F%B7%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0%E3%80%91bugs/CVE-2016-3510%E2%80%94%E2%80%94WebLogic%20%E5%8F%8D%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%E5%8C%96%E5%88%9D%E6%8E%A2.md","https://github.com/aw-junaid/Hacking-Tools/blob/62711d1b0ad3259f44b647a05da2680c094c9d6e/Penetration%20Testing/Penetration%20Testing%20Cheatsheet/CVE%20Exploits/WebLogic%20CVE-2016-3510.py","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d018